{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkbjwqfWEmuesH9d64e7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd open an account at פסגות and buy \"ילין לפידות מחקה S&P 500 (4D)\". The page marks both as \"הזול\" (the cheapest), and the account fee is shown in shekels: \"1,057 ₪\" over 10 years at פסגות, against \"6,576 ₪\" at הפועלים. That's the thing that decided it. With the page's example, 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month for 10 years at 7%, you end up with about **86,492 ₪**. You put in 70,000, so that's only about 16k more. I'm fairly sure about the account and the fund. I'm less sure about the final amount, because it never showed my own 30,000.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** The big heading \"איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד\" was exactly what I wanted. S&P 500 was already picked. Then the big numbers: \"הפקדתם 70,000 ₪\" and \"86,492 ₪\". Under it it says \"בכסף של היום\". I think that means after prices go up, but I'm not sure. Second place (the gray box beside it) was \"86,449\", only 43 ₪ less, so the fund choice barely matters.\n- **Screens 2–3:** The accounts list on the right is ranked by what's left at the end. פסגות is 1st. לאומי is 2nd at 83,396. הפועלים and יהב are lower at 81,471. On the left is the long fund list with tags like \"צוברת\", \"עסקת החלף\", \"נאמן\", \"חשיפה לדולר\". I skipped all the tags.\n- **Screen 4:** Some brokers I've never heard of, like אלטשולר טרייד, אקסלנס and מיטב טרייד, are way down around 63k. I also saw iShares and Vanguard funds marked \"אין מחיר כאן\" and skipped them.\n- **Screen 5:** I skimmed the Interactive Brokers box. A fund said \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\" with \"בין +2,212 ל־−23,766 ₪\", and that scared me off. I skipped the grey explanation text.\n- **Screen 6:** A chart with coloured lines. The table under it says more years means \"19,116 ₪ יותר\" and 600 a month means \"14,474 ₪ יותר\". The box \"עם נטרול מט\"ח או בלי\" lost me, so I stopped at screen 6 and didn't look at 7–10.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"נאמן\", \"צוברת\", \"עסקת החלף\", \"מנוטרלת מט\"ח\", \"מס גם על שינוי המטבע\", \"דמי משמרת\", \"UCITS\", \"W-8BEN\", \"אינפלציה\" as a button (I didn't know what it switches), and \"לא בחישוב\" next to the bank names.\n\n**Where I hesitated:**\n- I wanted to put in my 30,000, but the page shows 10,000 and these are only screenshots, so I couldn't move the slider.\n- I was surprised the 4th line on the left (קסם) showed \"−447\". I read that as losing money and didn't understand it.\n- Honestly I'm a bit uneasy about פסגות as a trading account. I know the name, but I'd trust my own bank more, and I don't know how to actually open the account.\n\n**What I'd change:** Put a \"start here\" step right at the top. Let me type my own amount easily. Cut the 30 tags on every fund. Explain \"בכסף של היום\" next to the big number, and explain the minus signs in the fund list."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1862,"cache_read_input_tokens":13811,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1862},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8541655c-1b97-4f30-99df-485cecc13069","uuid":"94f0dab0-eb6f-4368-aace-8ccfaacd03f7","timestamp":"2026-11-05T22:51:14.596Z","request_id":"req_011CgkbjwdFpHdF73EARa9uZ"}
